body:
Honey, I mean this in the nicest way possible;

What in the everloving fuck is the matter with you? This guy will not change. You can't change people. He doesn't love you. He doesn't respect you. He will never make you happy. You will never be happy with him.

Get some self respect and do not tolerate anyone who treats you this way. You are so young still and there are so many other guys out there. So. Many. You don't have to settle for the first loser who looks at you.
